From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 14:18:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 17/19] explorer: Use Files as the file manager in the Material
 3 style.

The Android app starts C:\windows\wfm.exe, its own file manager, when
there is no program to run. In the Material 3 style it is replaced by a
copy of Files at startup and kept as wfm-winlator.exe, and put back for
the other styles. explorer also opens folders in Files. Both follow a
new switch on the settings page, on by default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019oF8nnfMD8z5Z1MeNXoYS9
